    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d755-a2">

                <pb facs="0533" n="461" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg461"/>

                <p>The above address was unanimously adopted by the council, and a resolution was
                    passed to send it to the President of the United States of America, through the
                    consul in Leghorn. It was also resolved to open a subscription to erect a
                    monument in Pisa to the memory of the great man.</p>
                <p>A true extract from the original:</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ALFONSO GIARRIZZO BUETTO,</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President</hi>.</closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p rendition="#flush">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">F. Gagliardi Sforza</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary</hi>.</p>
                    <p rendition="#flush">Unity, liberty, fraternity! The Montanelli democratic
                        society in Pisa.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
